description:
Decided 2026-09-16 (target architecture, docs/architecture/target-architecture.md, §9.1 D-13): stage 2 — and with it Omnigent step M2, cross-vendor review — opens on four measured criteria, not on a feeling:
1. at least three full seven-phase runs with metrics in this repository;
2. lakeswitch-ai's disclosure decision written;
3. the leak check green in every run;
4. the foreign reviewer's endpoint declared with residency in model-endpoints.yaml.
Implement-phase cost is measured, not a switch.

This item delivers criterion 1 and records criterion 3 for each run: per phase the tokens, wall time, human minutes and gate outcomes, generated rather than typed, each run with the commit it measured. It succeeds portfolio's earlier measurement item (uqvm there). Criteria 2 and 4 are decisions outside this item; it reports their state when it closes.
